config BR2_PACKAGE_ZYPEROS_EQ
	bool "zyperos-eq"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	help
	  ZyperOS's equalizer as a LADSPA plugin, for ports: launch.sh
	  runs a port's sound through it, by alsa-lib's ladspa PCM, while
	  the equalizer is on (ZyperOS's sd/zyperos/eq-port.sh). Its
	  arithmetic is ZyperOS's src/eqdsp.h, read from the tree at
	  /zyperos as the zyperos and diatom packages read theirs.
